        "23bf203b-f3b0-401c-8e48-fd86c856162a": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 304,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- The Piloterr account must have **credits**: each run uses one crawler request and one rendering request (rendering costs more than crawler). `GET /v2/usage` (Get Usage) is free.\n- The page under test is `https://example.com`; both branches expect its `Example Domain` heading.\n- The Web Unlocker engine is not run here (the most expensive engine); it uses the same code path with another path segment."
        }
